  "extraction_notes": [
    "The datasheet publishes minimum and maximum hFE values only at the listed table conditions; both bounds at IC = 10 mA are retained as separate gain points.",
    "The transition-frequency table row is a minimum of 100 MHz and also lists a 300 MHz maximum; the schema stores the minimum and the maximum is noted here.",
    "Cib is not tabulated on page 1; the page 2 Cib curve was digitized separately from the Cob curve.",
    "Curve points are manual digitizations from the plotted lines on page 2 at visible axis or grid coordinates; no points were interpolated between reported points.",
    "The page 1 electrical characteristics are specified at Ta = 25 degC unless otherwise specified, and the hFE and saturation rows are pulse-tested with pulse width <= 300 us and duty cycle <= 2.0%.",
    "The maximum ratings table also gives VCBO = 180 V, VEBO = 6 V, IC = 0.6 A, PC = 0.3 W, and Tj = 150 degC; the strict BJT extraction schema has no fields for these additional limits."
